{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30016_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:112cc1b404de830899f7e78e3facc3154e6ce9f1195db2f5d04c26e8781019ef",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41dd62a02781ae5ad6713bfaba3286fba4a41cda4df06e17fc62c96304d85256",
      "text": "夕阳胶卷",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c17ae7759d557f58b32653d24de7174da6ae7e0cb25597d0635e2d52cad8a5b2",
      "text": "确定出演数码相机宣传活动的神速一魂。\n两人决定亲自去拍摄照片。\n听到拍摄主题后，朱雀觉得这对玄武来说，\n会不会是一份很难完成的工作，于是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000016:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000016:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41dd62a02781ae5ad6713bfaba3286fba4a41cda4df06e17fc62c96304d85256",
      "text": "夕阳胶卷",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:392d6b70e94acf46916a244d7b4c906a13bf81724b61c8a5e982641a6d7eb369",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n找上我们的新工作是什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31010fcbe2b264ade8002f5e6ea4a62914437e21f44c09ef7c8d19d907245f33",
      "text": "好的！是新发售的数码相机的\n宣传活动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f024ad104ba72a2c0a90520ed92280e0d87a0c8796c304751917c657b9b07b",
      "text": "找我们的，居然是相机！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1692c59691c334c861b8afe1c2da17d5dcc7692bf311b0c5fc459ae989a30def",
      "text": "是的。听说这次的宣传活动\n是以年轻群体为目标客户，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e0d7094e3f4ce21964e0cdcc2d995d3146ff56eedfb4fc5d0129620ebd1184c",
      "text": "对方非常坚决地希望\n“务必请身为现役高中生的神速一魂来代言”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dbefcca380678e9b311a41a6f740b367076b393c4ab15ca1596f9efc34c45a2",
      "text": "同时，他们还想把《オモイノウタ》\n作为形象歌曲来使用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87a95982373bd198a6a8b0d8b8f2bcb0132815e22ce2fd66d7c9b04af83b5aeb",
      "text": "哦哦！真的假的啊！\n这不是挺会说话的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92676df130f98dd2d5ad9225285bc105164ba1f70ad9315640786a4ccfd886e7",
      "text": "既然都说到这份上了，那就干了！\n你说呢，玄武？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ba1b4334aebf094a53b571c85c987fdf0015af803b84c66e4af39a0c123bf47",
      "text": "啊啊，那是自然。\n看来对方对我们的期待相当高啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25c8929d6d996b5f59eb399c6c73286ca7f74ebe4c378d109fcde008ec462670",
      "text": "意气轩昂。打起精神来上吧，搭档！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
